title: The Hamburg Mandates
subtitle: The mandate commission must say who may vote.
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_heidelberg = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and heid_cg_mandates = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.heid_cg_mandates = 1;
RG.congress.tally();
!}
frequency: 400
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Hamburg Mandates

The fight over the theses begins as a fight over paper. Wilhelm Pieck's mandate commission has the credentials of Hamburg and Bremen on the table. Hamburg elected its delegates at a mass meeting nobody from the Zentrale was allowed to address. Bremen has paid no dues to the Zentrale since the spring.

Laufenberg tells the commission that if Hamburg's delegates are struck off, Hamburg will draw its own conclusions.

- @annul: Strike off the irregular mandates.
- @consult: Seat them with a voice, but no vote.
- @seat: Seat them in full, and beat them in the debate.

@annul
subtitle: Many of their votes vanish. The split, if it comes, will be uglier.
on-arrival: {!
var n = RG.congress.annul('hamburg', 'ultraleft', 0.6) + RG.congress.annul('bremen', 'ultraleft', 0.5);
Q.congress_last_moved = n;
RG.congress.bitter(6);
Q.unity -= 5;
Q.heid_split_share = Math.min(0.85, Q.heid_split_share + 0.05);
RG.district('hamburg', {loyalty: -10});
RG.district('bremen', {loyalty: -8});
!}

The commission finds that the Hamburg and Bremen meetings were improperly called. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] Left Radical delegates lose their votes and watch from the back of the room. ?] Our side has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.

@consult
subtitle: A lawyer's answer. Fewer votes lost, and fewer tempers.
on-arrival: {!
var n = RG.congress.annul('hamburg', 'ultraleft', 0.3) + RG.congress.annul('bremen', 'ultraleft', 0.25);
Q.congress_last_moved = n;
RG.congress.bitter(3);
Q.unity -= 2;
!}

Hamburg and Bremen may speak as long as they like. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] of their delegates may not vote. ?] Our side has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.

@seat
subtitle: Party democracy. Fewer will follow them out if they walk.
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity += 4;
Q.heid_split_share = Math.max(0.55, Q.heid_split_share - 0.05);
RG.congress.sway(0.03);
!}

Every delegate is seated. The Left Radicals, who expected to be robbed, are disarmed for an evening. Our side has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.
